# Trick Shot (CR 115.1, 120.3): the first target takes 6 and the optional second target, an other creature token (here a Goblin token, which may be either player's),
# takes 2; each dies, and the creature that wasn't targeted is unharmed. A nontoken creature, or the first target again, is refused for the second.

